      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just want to add that while Xiexe's Inventory System can already sort of do this, the new avatar ranking system isn't too favorable on it. Each item needs 2 animation controllers in order to for it to be toggable, but keeping a model in Good ranking would only allow you to make 1 inventory item. Any more than makes it instantly Medium. On top of that it only works with objects that are on a separate mesh, so there's still no way to toggle blendshapes on your main model.\nHaving a more streamlined and officially supported way to toggle props and other animations is definitely needed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
