  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-24T17:28:22.604Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I propose a new menu with 8 slots that work much like gestures and animations but the only difference is these are toggleable. One click turns it on, click it again to turn it off. As an 8 slot menu, in Unity we can program .anim files to those slots - examples: props to appear on our avatars, turning our own avatar chairs on/off, playing a custom AFK animation on/off - the possibilities are endless to whatever you make them as. I ask for an 8 slot \"toggle\" menu that we may use for toggleable custom .anim files.",
